package web

// Brand marks, inlined from assets/brand.
//
// Inlined rather than served as files for two reasons. The wordmark is drawn in
// currentColor, so it follows the theme instead of being black on a dark page —
// an <img> cannot do that without shipping two files that can disagree. And the
// mark appears in the collapsed rail, where a second request would leave a gap
// on every navigation.
//
// The two teals in the mark are the brand's own, and --brand is set from the
// same values, so the interface and the logo cannot drift apart.

// brandMark is the letter O, drawn.
//
// A ring rather than a glyph. A font cannot be relied on to be installed, and
// an outlined glyph is a name nothing can read — which is how the wordmark
// that used to sit here went on spelling "Yacht" for months after the rename.
// This one is a shape that happens to be a letter; the name itself is text
// beside it, so nothing here has to be read to know it.
//
// The counter is an ellipse, 64 across and 66 down. Equal radii look wrong at
// this weight: a stroke of constant thickness reads heavier where it runs
// horizontally, so the top and bottom are thinned. Every geometric typeface
// makes the same correction to its O.
//
// Two teals in a vertical gradient rather than one flat fill, because they are
// the brand's own and --brand is set from the same values — the interface and
// the logo cannot drift apart.
//
// width and height are on the element, not only in the viewBox. Without an
// intrinsic size a `w-auto` has nothing to resolve against, and an SVG in a
// flex row collapses to zero — which is what the text it replaced never did.
templ brandMark(class string) {
	<svg class={ class } width="256" height="256" viewBox="0 0 256 256" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Ozymandis">
		<defs>
			<linearGradient id="ozymandis-o" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
				<stop offset="0" style="stop-color:rgb(74,168,154)"></stop>
				<stop offset="1" style="stop-color:rgb(33,149,132)"></stop>
			</linearGradient>
		</defs>
		<path fill-rule="evenodd" style="fill:url(#ozymandis-o)" d="M 16,128 a 112,112 0 1,0 224,0 a 112,112 0 1,0 -224,0 Z M 64,128 a 64,66 0 1,0 128,0 a 64,66 0 1,0 -128,0 Z"></path>
	</svg>
}

